{% comment %}
  Loads the design system: fonts, CSS and the JS that wires interactive components.
  Params:
    - reset (bool, optional) — also load pos-reset.css
    - auto_init_components (bool, optional, default true) — initialize popovers, dialogs, collapsible
      lists, code highlighting and data-load-content automatically. Pass false on pages that create
      those instances themselves (the docs site does).
{% endcomment %}
